WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.550
Today’s lesson might sound dry, definitions, but stay with me, because this is where a lot of easy points live.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.100
Every rule we’ll study depends on the words defined in Rule three.

3
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.125
Is that boat sailing or power-driven?

4
00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:17.050
Is she underway?

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.425
Is she engaged in fishing?

6
00:00:19.675 --> 00:00:25.075
A huge number of exam questions are really definition questions in disguise.

7
00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:29.250
Get these words right, and every later lesson gets easier.

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.775
So let’s go through them the way a captain would, with real examples.
